            at Checkit from Palm Harbor, Florida.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-neutral leading-relaxed">
            I live in Palm Harbor, FL with my wife Whitney and our four girls.
            I enjoy golfing, going to the beach, and traveling to new places.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <img
            class="rounded-2xl object-cover w-64 h-64"
            src="/stephen_newman.jpeg"
            alt="Stephen Newman"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
